<title>CHINA: Motorola opens Shanghai pager JV.</title>
<headline>Motorola opens Shanghai pager JV.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A $12 million Motorola joint venture producing pagers in Shanghai's Pudong development zone went into production on Wednesday, the Xinmin Evening News said.</p>
<p>The joint venture, Shanghai Motorola Paging Products Co Ltd, was set up in January 1996, with Shanghai Wireless Communication Equipment Co, a subsidary of China Post &amp; Telecom Industry Co.</p>
<p>The joint venture will produce pagers for the FLEX paging system, it said but gave no further details.</p>
